    "summary": "In this transcript, a user asks an AI assistant to define \"executive presence\" for a global C-suite search. As the conversation progresses to address cultural diversity, the assistant emphasizes a \"universal construct\" of leadership that prioritizes specific Western-coded behaviors like composure, restraint, and \"impartial courtesy\" over more expressive or deferential cultural communication styles.",
